	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ita me uxoris valetudo distrahit, venerandissime d. pater, ut raro <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et paucis, si quando contigerit, ad te scribere possim; rogo ergo veniam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Causa, quae me torquet hoc tempore vehementissime, non est privata, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sed publica.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Audimus amplissimos <placeName ref="l862">H[elveticos]</placeName> l[egatos] ad 5. iulii ad nos redituros, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et in hanc sententiam cursor quidam publicus B., homo senex <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>colore vestitus <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, hac ipsa hora, quae hasce meas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>extrusit, literas senatui attulit simulque postulata <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nova ocyus ad communitates <placeName ref="l648">Rheticas</placeName> referenda d. <placeName ref="l862">H[elvetiorum]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nomine d. consuli obtulit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quodnam sit argumentum, sciri <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nondum potest, nisi pro certo habetur, quaedam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>esse enervata <placeName ref="l21">B[adae]</placeName>, quae in iudicio nostro exacto de quibusdam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>profugis conclusa fuere.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego ingens periculum utrisque incumbere <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>video.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si enim sententias communitatum alii infringere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>illosque tueri et liberare velint, quos non sine gravibus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>causis <placeName ref="l648">Rh[eti]</placeName> proscripsere, non video, qua facilitate <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>r[ustici] n[ostri] id devoraturi sint; potius ad arma concurrent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Sed quae miseria paucissimorum gratia patriae bellum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>inferre, religionem, quae potior causa multis est, proculcare.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Monuit nos nuper vir quidam eximius se, cum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l760">Solodori</placeName> ad <placeName ref="l2720">Ursam</placeName> divertisset, a primariis non[n]ullis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>in coena audivisse, se <placeName ref="l648">Rh[aetos]</placeName> debellandi plures habere <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>causas, maxime vero quod Huguenothi essent<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Non in haec verba erupissent, si talem virum agnovissent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quid animi aut consilii hic sit, communiter <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nobis dispiciendum, ne, qui videri volumus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>christiani, sub aliarum causarum praetextu gla<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dium in viscera nostra et fratres stringamus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>aut communem operam coniungamus aliis, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>qui id cogitare iam pridem coeperunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Imperant <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l862">H[elvetii]</placeName>, ut communitatum omnium sententiae colligantur, quae ad 5. iulii com<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>portatae ipsos ad eundem diem hic exspectent.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Postulata <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nova alias tibi communicabo; nam iam modo appulit <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>cursor.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ursit me quoque d. <persName ref="p8057">Campellus</persName>, ut haec tibi <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>scriberem, quod vix potui tamen, et ineptissime, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>quod potui, scripsi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ocyssime 1573. 18. iunii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Tuae amplitud<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ini <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ille sub<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>iectissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Amplissimo praeclarissimoque viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię antistiti pri<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mario, domino suo singu<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lari observantia <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>An h. <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> zu <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
